2026-09-14T23:39:37.401Z {"ok":true,"did":"text","text":"C H I M E R A\ncamera · Mira\nTHE LESSON\n‹\n3 / 10\n›\nTHE HEALING\n\nThe creature's skin is elastic: the moment you let go, the dent unwinds and the squeezed water flows away, fading to zero in a few seconds. Wake any cell past 0.02 MPa, then take your hand off and simply wait. Nothing heals while you keep holding; the healing begins when you let go.\n\nPASSED — you let go, and the body healed itself. it never needed you.\nYOUR HAND\n5700 N\ngentle ≤\nhand strength\nlet go\nhand open\nstand at rest\n\ndrag = look around · click = touch · wheel = zoom\n\nTHE CREATURE'S BLOOD\ncell 0: V=0.288 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 1: V=12.509 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 2: V=0.693 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 3: V=0.335 m3  P=0.000 MPa\n\nconserve: -0.00 %\nsave progress"}
