2026-09-14T23:40:04.934Z {"ok":true,"did":"text","text":"C H I M E R A\ncamera · Mira\nTHE LESSON\n‹\n4 / 10\n›\nBEND THE KNEE\n\nThe creature listens to more than touches — it listens to intents. A pose is a wish you post: bend the left knee to 40 degrees and the body rearranges its water to match, cells shifting as the joint turns. Set the left knee to 40 and watch the pressures answer.\n\nknee_L → 40°\nthe creature waits.\nYOUR HAND\n5700 N\ngentle ≤\nhand strength\nlet go\nhand open\nstand at rest\n\ndrag = look around · click = touch · wheel = zoom\n\nTHE CREATURE'S BLOOD\ncell 0: V=0.288 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 1: V=12.509 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 2: V=0.693 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 3: V=0.335 m3  P=0.000 MPa\n\nconserve: -0.00 %\nsave progress"}
