2026-09-14T23:47:31.645Z {"ok":true,"did":"text","text":"C H I M E R A\ncamera · Mira\nTHE LESSON\n‹\n6 / 10\n›\nTHE BALANCE\n\nThe creature listens to two wishes at once. Post the left ankle to 5 degrees and the right to -5 — two small, opposing turns — and feel the water lean: one foot pressurises whilst the other eases off. Balance is not a place; it is two wishes held against each other.\n\nankle_L → 5°\nthe creature waits.\nYOUR HAND\n5700 N\ngentle ≤\nhand strength\nlet go\nhand open\nstand at rest\n\ndrag = look around · click = touch · wheel = zoom\n\nTHE CREATURE'S BLOOD\ncell 0: V=0.288 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 1: V=12.509 m3  P=0.003 MPa\ncell 2: V=0.693 m3  P=0.000 MPa\ncell 3: V=0.335 m3  P=0.000 MPa\n\nconserve: -0.00 %\nsave progress"}
